## Python Code Style

- Type hints on every function — no bare `def func(x):`
- f-strings for string formatting — not `.format()` or `%`
- `pathlib.Path` for file paths — not `os.path`
- `asyncio.gather()` for parallel async calls
- Never `time.sleep()` in async code — use `await asyncio.sleep()`
- `logging` module for structured logs — not bare `print()` in production code
- Exception handling: catch specific exceptions, not bare `except:`
